# ── KLI Studio — no provider secrets here ──────────────────────────────
#
# The Studio (browser) never talks to a model provider directly. Every call
# (agent, chat, images, embeddings, audio, model catalogue) is forwarded by
# @kli/server, which owns the credentials. So there are NO VITE_* keys to set.
#
# Configure the provider once, server-side, in the repo root `.env`:
#
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:31415/v1   # FreeLLMAPI (default)
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=freellmapi-...
#   KLI_MODEL=auto
#
# Then point the Studio at the running server (Settings → Conexión → Servidor
# del harness, default http://127.0.0.1:4317). This file is intentionally empty;
# Vite only needs `.env.local` if you want to change something app-level.
